Provenance and licensing for the ``bag3d.export.ifc`` package
=============================================================

This package contains the CityJSON-to-IFC conversion logic used by the
3DBAG pipeline's IFC export.

Vendored files
--------------

The following files are a modified version of the ``ifccityjson`` converter
from IfcOpenShell (https://github.com/IfcOpenShell/IfcOpenShell), as adapted
for 3DBAG by the IFC3DBAG project (https://github.com/tudelft3d/IFC3DBAG):

- ``geometry.py``      - copied from IfcOpenShell, modified
- ``cityjson2ifc.py``  - copied from IfcOpenShell, modified (see below)

